{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55533","headline":"偈 一 · 契此","name":"偈 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"是非憎爱多世偏多，子细思量奈我何。\n宽却肚肠须（《布袋和尚传》、《明州岳林寺志》作「皮常」）忍辱，豁开心地任从他（《明州岳林寺志》作「放开笑中暗消磨」，《布袋和尚传》「笑口」作「泆日」，似误。\n）若逢知己须依分，纵遇冤家也共和。\n若能了此心头事（《布袋和尚传》、《明州岳林寺志》作「能使此心无絓碍」），自然证得六波罗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"契此","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}